Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.30,0:00:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars and reach for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the sky I believe in tomorrow if we try!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.38,0:00:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.18,0:00:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the music!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the good times!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the good times!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, baby, baby, oh,\Nwe share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to see for you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the darkness\Nthat is in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So hard to see, but to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In where we need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you and me, it's true that we.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the rush brought on by this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Through head to feet, I feel the beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting me to walk on, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times, take my hand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.98,0:00:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.06,0:01:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.86,0:01:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.22,0:01:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.96,0:01:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, as we chase, we're being chased.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,From the top we go, one straight and wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.72,0:01:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way. I've got to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.78,0:01:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I want to share your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.48,0:01:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here it starts, so don't lose heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.74,0:01:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bound to lose to this flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,From boot to hood, I feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be free to be, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.40,0:01:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, even if I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, I know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times, show us that smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.98,0:01:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.38,0:01:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.78,0:01:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go, beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:02:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow if we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.82,0:02:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you are there,\Njust on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait there for me, soon\Nit will be you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let us go, beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the one world if we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.98,0:02:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody,\Noh, we share the music, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby,\Noh, we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.92,0:02:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.26,0:02:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark King Silver's Rayleigh, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.06,0:02:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow nobody recognized him,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,so they're about to sell\Nhim off at an auction
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.38,0:02:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,like they would any other normal old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.78,0:02:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're selling the Dark King as a slave?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.06,0:02:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It does seem far-fetched\Nto be honest. My men
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.04,0:02:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't even entirely\Ncertain it's actually him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:03:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Teeth yes sir so how\Nshould we handle this vice
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.84,0:03:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,admiral should I report\Nit to fleet admiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.14,0:03:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku no i intend to handle this myself
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,don't tell anyone about\Nthis not even sengoku
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.74,0:03:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and make sure your men\Nkeep their mouths shut
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but sir what if it\Nreally is the dark king?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.66,0:03:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,oh it's him all right there's\Nno doubt about it huh this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't the first sighting of\Nhim on the islands that's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,been reported he's probably\Nracked up some gambling
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,debt and sold himself in\Norder to pay it off Rayleigh
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.96,0:03:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,may be an old man but if we\Ndon't approach him carefully
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.84,0:03:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the military will lose an\Nunthinkable number of men
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.76,0:03:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the timing couldn't be worse
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.64,0:03:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you really think the navy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,has the manpower to take on\Ntwo legends at the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.44,0:03:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,all
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.35,0:03:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,right
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.42,0:03:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,ladies
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.33,0:03:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and gentlemen
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:03:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,thank you for joining us
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.52,0:04:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,the moment you've been waiting\Nfor has finally arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.90,0:04:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the monthly great human\Nauction of grove number one is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.24,0:04:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,about to begin and here comes\Neveryone's favorite emcee?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he is, the walking super\Nbazaar himself, Mr. Disco!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,As always, we've collected the finest\Nlineup of slaves for your wants and needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And you are in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got an extra special\Nitem for sale today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.36,0:04:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I pray from the bottom of\Nmy heart that each and every
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,one of you will leave with\Nthe slave of your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.72,0:04:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but enough talk let's get this auction\Ngoing you heard the man get two and three
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,ready to go yeah i'm on it item number
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.30,0:04:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,one hails from torah in the west blue
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:05:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,he's a proud pirate from a long line\Nof musicians and what a talent hand him
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,any instrument you like name a song and\Njust watch him go he's a living breathing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.64,0:05:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,jukebox for your home a jukebox that'll\Nmop up any unsightly mess you spill it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.46,0:05:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll clean it up and he's an expert\Nwinemaker he's a 25 year old human in his
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.72,0:05:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,prime just look six foot four 286 pounds\Ngoing by the name of Byron we'll start
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,the bidding at 480,000 berries all right
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.52,0:05:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,let's see those paddles and hear your bids
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,number seven is opening it up with our\Nstarting price do we have another bid
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sold for 600,000 berries
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.32,0:05:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What a sick joke, Devil? Is\Nthis list what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.86,0:05:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, market prices This is insane
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Standard starting price\Nfor a human is 500,000
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,berries Male giants start\Nat 50 million Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Female mermaids are\Nworth 70 million berries?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why everyone goes after mermaids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.88,0:06:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's their get-rich-quick scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.78,0:06:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lot of berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, once they get bought, they\Nlose every ounce of their freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.82,0:06:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They usually wind up as decorations\Nfor some rich snob living
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.26,0:06:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,out their lives in cramped\Nfish tanks as exotic eye candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.16,0:06:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you even telling me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.12,0:06:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I say living, but you really\Ncan't call it that, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's how you feel,\Nhurry up and find her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.32,0:06:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We've done a thorough search of all the\Nkidnapping rings in grove number 20, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.14,0:06:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Make this thing go faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you get off my ass, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,She ain't a bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.79,0:06:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs a running start to get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.10,0:06:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.01,0:07:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.88,0:07:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, it was a damn giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.94,0:07:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How often did you find a giant sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.04,0:07:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the easiest catch of my life, but\Nit was still a pain hauling the thing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.22,0:07:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A giant like that would normally be the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.40,0:07:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,main attraction and we'd\Nall be billionaires,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.72,0:07:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.82,0:07:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Some jerk's got to go\Nand bring a mermaid in
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,at the last minute before\Nthe auction starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.14,0:07:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, who brought in the mermaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.38,0:07:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fish number five.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, attention all rosy life riders!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.30,0:07:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in, riders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.70,0:07:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got an idea on the kidnapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.68,0:07:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Peterman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.70,0:07:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Word is he sold the mermaid to the\Nauction house on growth number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.27,0:07:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Peterman!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.19,0:07:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know where to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.66,0:07:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be flying so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.40,0:08:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope she hasn't\Nbeen sold off already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.70,0:08:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Grove number one is right around\Nthe corner, just leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.18,0:08:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're headed for the auction house!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You, you mean we know where she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.26,0:08:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.74,0:08:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And a move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.26,0:08:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to get back to my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.26,0:08:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Fellas know where grove number one is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.52,0:08:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, well sure we do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.12,0:08:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.58,0:08:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Up next, entry number six\Nfor your consideration.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.98,0:08:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A ten-pack of stout and\Nsturdy male human laborers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.10,0:08:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Calling all units.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.70,0:08:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Head to grove number one, and someone\Nread off the auction schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.66,0:08:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It started at four.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.28,0:08:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been going for 30 minutes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we going to make it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.38,0:08:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.58,0:08:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A mermaid's always considered\Na big-ticket attraction,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.96,0:08:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,so they won't auction her\Noff until the second half.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:08:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take the fastest route you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.80,0:09:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a lot slower than the flying fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, you just sit back and take\Nit easy there, young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.06,0:09:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a reason why I'm the\Nboss of this team, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.66,0:09:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you notice me change direction back\Nwhen we found out where the mermaid was?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.98,0:09:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been steering us toward Grove No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.80,0:09:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,1 since the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.56,0:09:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look, that's the auction house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.88,0:09:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss is always going to be\Nthe first to crash the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.66,0:09:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell'd you know where to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.56,0:09:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you got some kidnapper intuition?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.54,0:09:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, little buddy, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.24,0:09:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, it's Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.98,0:09:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,First one there, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.48,0:09:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:09:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.84,0:09:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Two million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.52,0:10:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Any other bids?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.54,0:10:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.88,0:10:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you mean\Nyou can't give her back?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.44,0:10:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.35,0:10:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how things work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no right to sell Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.76,0:10:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's in\Nthe wrong here, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.12,0:10:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep harassing us and we'll\Nhave to sue you for...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,obstruction of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.92,0:10:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Business my ass, you heartless turd.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.02,0:10:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a business.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just profiting off\Nthe misery of the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A lawless pirate like you has no\Nright to lecture me on morality.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.18,0:10:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Slavery is considered\Ntaboo the whole world over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.76,0:10:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How much are you paying the\Ngovernment to get away with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a very nice thing to say,\Nbut you're not too far off base.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.20,0:10:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit that whenever the\Ngovernment or the Navy stops by,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,they have a very difficult time\Nhearing the words human trafficking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, I get the impression they don't have\Na clue that we're selling anyone at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.84,0:10:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What a load of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.10,0:10:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We know you're in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.62,0:11:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is the government\Nthinking letting this fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares that they look the other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.44,0:11:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be ashamed of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.04,0:11:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't make me\Ntell you a third time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.78,0:11:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.98,0:11:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If we know the mermaid's\Nhere, we're wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.36,0:11:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ew!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.27,0:11:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There are celestial\Ndragons in there, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.70,0:11:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And if they got Kuma, you know they\Nput one of those colors on her by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.64,0:11:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the ones that explode?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.02,0:11:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we can't take\Nher out by force, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all welcome to leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.34,0:11:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome to choke on my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Sanji. Calm down. We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.16,0:11:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit holding me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let it go. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.48,0:11:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You know this creep deserves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.44,0:11:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami, where are you running off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.24,0:11:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.86,0:11:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can't beat them with our\Nfists then we're just gonna have to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.32,0:12:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,beat these bastards at their own\Ngame go ahead and prepare number
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.52,0:12:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,15 and number 16
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.98,0:12:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you got it please
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.36,0:12:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,don't I can't handle this\Nplease don't make me be a slave
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.60,0:12:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.24,0:12:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,go
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.66,0:12:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Already will you call the Navy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.96,0:12:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go to jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.32,0:12:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't tell me to someone
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.40,0:12:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey boss, isn't that the straw\Nhat crew that just walked in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but the Straw Hat\Ncaptain ain't with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.06,0:12:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shame, since I'd like to see if\Nthat bastard's as crazy as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.88,0:13:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving right along, we've\Ngot entry number 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Up next, we've got a deal\Nyou simply cannot turn down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.86,0:13:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Entry 15 is an amazingly\Nbeautiful female human.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.52,0:13:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just feast your eyes on those curves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a 20-year-old dancer named Pasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.18,0:13:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just imagine waking up to the sight\Nof this beguiling vision every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.28,0:13:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Such transcendent beauty is sure to\Nconvince you you've died and gone to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this what they're going to do to Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.64,0:13:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you,\Nwe're getting Kuma back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.16,0:13:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm having a little trouble\Nseeing how in this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a good deal of treasure\Nback on the sunny, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.92,0:13:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got to be worth\Nat least $200 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's the starting\Nmarket price for mermaids?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.10,0:13:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ew, that's more than enough, but\Nthere's no way I can pay all that back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Hachi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you K-Me's legal\Nguardian or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.90,0:13:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ew, no, that's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.90,0:13:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kami's our friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.48,0:13:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and we'll do whatever it takes to get\Nher back, no matter how much it costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.74,0:13:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:13:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.85,0:14:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Money's the last thing I care about!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.96,0:14:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys, thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.94,0:14:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're like the greatest\Npeople I've ever known!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it when she's spicy, but I love\Nwhen Nami's sweet! Shut up! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.10,0:14:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster! Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.02,0:14:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing what I can, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.02,0:14:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it faster, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.74,0:14:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already at Grove number two, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.12,0:14:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Not much farther to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.80,0:14:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if the others are already there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,WE'RE GONNA SAVE YOU, Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.12,0:14:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Extra, extra!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:14:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Read all about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.90,0:15:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Has the world government lost their minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.14,0:15:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.28,0:15:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If they do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This spells trouble with\Na capital T, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.02,0:15:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that answers that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.62,0:15:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.53,0:15:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.24,0:15:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It finally makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.80,0:15:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I wondered why there were\Nso few marines stationed
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,on an island within spitting\Ndistance of a navy base.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.58,0:15:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The commander of\NWhitebeard's second division,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.68,0:15:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire Fist Ace, is to be publicly executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.24,0:15:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no way\NWhitebeard won't retaliate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.78,0:15:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This can only result in war.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.04,0:15:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Entry number 15!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.16,0:15:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The beautiful dancer Pasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.38,0:15:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Her starting price of 800,000 berries has
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.68,0:15:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,skyrocketed to the winning\Nbid of 7.2 million berries!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.16,0:16:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally arrived. It's about time, but\Nthings are really starting to get fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.70,0:16:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,up so let's keep the show moving feast\Nyour eyes on the next piece of merchandise
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.58,0:16:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,what a relief sounds like it's still
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.72,0:16:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,going well that may be true sir I
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.54,0:16:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,believe I just heard him say they were\Non entry number 15 which would mean the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.94,0:16:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Auction is almost over because this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Over slow getting yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.92,0:16:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Put this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.64,0:16:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,one up for
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.55,0:16:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,sale I don't need it anymore I'll make
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the arrangements at once hmm celestial
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.88,0:16:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,dragon another one huh lots of nobility\Nhere and a navy admiral will come running
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.92,0:16:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,to the rescue if we defy one of them\Nwhat I really want to buy is a Mermaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.20,0:16:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I do hope they have one this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.48,0:16:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Merfolk are a notoriously\Ndifficult species to capture,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.30,0:16:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,so I fear you may leave\Nhere disappointed yet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.82,0:16:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.76,0:16:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Charles, what a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.60,0:16:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.80,0:17:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take me to my seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.14,0:17:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I see my brother's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.62,0:17:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, better late than never.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.94,0:17:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's resume, shall we? I present to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.28,0:17:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you entry number 16 oh my the captain of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.24,0:17:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,a pirate ship with a bounty of 17 million
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,berries it's captain la cuba he's an
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.68,0:17:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,insightful strategist but don't let that\Nfool you he's in great physical shape as
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,well you can use him as a guide or as a\Nhorse as manual labor or as a punching bag
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.64,0:17:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,the possibilities are endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just... Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.54,0:18:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.12,0:18:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I saw blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.76,0:18:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the curtains.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened I couldn't\Ntell he bit off his tongue
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.40,0:18:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,he decided he'd rather die\Nthan live with someone's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.62,0:18:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,pet he saw no other way\Nout than to take his own
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,life in this case that\Ncould be the smart choice
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,where's the mermaid already\Namy must be so scared
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.72,0:18:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,this is awful just hang\Non a little longer no
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.02,0:18:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,matter what happens we\Nwill save her it's a good
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.88,0:18:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,thing we've got all that\Ntreasure from Thriller Bark.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.16,0:18:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you all so much for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.54,0:18:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No good. Sorry, sir. Damn it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.64,0:18:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm not gonna make\None berry off of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.14,0:18:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The mermaid's next, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.78,0:18:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.69,0:18:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.61,0:18:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She can go up at any time. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.12,0:18:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Get her on stage now. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.02,0:19:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems entry number 16,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.26,0:19:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirate captain La Cuba was so\Nnervous to see you all that he collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.10,0:19:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,from a nosebleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.48,0:19:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,His auction will have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.98,0:19:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We apologize for any inconvenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.34,0:19:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,the next item I have to show you\Nis nothing short of incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This highly sought-after prize is\Nsure to be on everyone's wish list.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.36,0:19:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, bring it to the stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This item is far too amazing to reveal\Nall at once, so we'll take it in steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.22,0:19:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe the silhouette.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.96,0:19:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It could really be. Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.64,0:19:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Did that whet your appetite?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.16,0:19:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, try not to drool, folks,\Nbecause here comes the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.98,0:20:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All the way from?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Island, the mermaid came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hotting in the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have come here to rescue me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.64,0:20:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Koby!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.55,0:20:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're selling her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.47,0:20:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.38,0:20:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.42,0:20:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get her back no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.10,0:20:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,200 million is gonna be\Nmore than enough. Koby!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.80,0:20:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it! A mermaid!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.36,0:20:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They're selling a mermaid!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.78,0:20:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,500 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.84,0:20:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I bid $500 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.24,0:20:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:20:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't compete with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.78,0:21:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.40,0:21:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have nearly\Nthat much What a waste of
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.76,0:21:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,money Did you forget the\Npiranhas in your aquarium?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.78,0:21:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She won't last an hour in there\NIt'll be fun to watch her try though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.14,0:21:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Merfolk are the fastest swimmers\Nin the world, or so they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hear anything\Nthey're saying out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pachin, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.28,0:21:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Rescue me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.18,0:21:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone appears to be at a loss for\Nwords, but I'll ask just the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.92,0:21:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Does anyone out there have a bid\Nhigher than 500 million berries?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.30,0:21:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we do anything about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.24,0:21:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, there's got to\Nbe something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.26,0:21:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Sanji, what's the plan, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't any time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.06,0:21:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't do something now, they'll take\Nher away and we'll never get her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.80,0:21:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.00,0:21:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have known we\Ncouldn't compete with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.00,0:21:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Those creeps throw money\Naround like it grows on trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.14,0:21:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This just isn't our game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.82,0:22:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If not, then I'll bring the\Nbidding straight to a close.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.96,0:22:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.48,0:22:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.39,0:22:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let this happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.50,0:22:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to help her escape\Nto the ocean by force!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.16,0:22:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.22,0:22:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the collar?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.36,0:22:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want her head to explode?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.18,0:22:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.09,0:22:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm just gonna have to\Nfind a way to get the key, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.80,0:22:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's it. Time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.08,0:22:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.40,0:22:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just a taste of\Nwhat the world holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.92,0:22:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all a damn farce.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.78,0:22:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.48,0:22:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Bidding has ended, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.10,0:22:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's showcased item,\Nthe young mermaid, Kuma,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.14,0:22:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,goes to the world noble saint,\NChalas, for his bid of...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.54,0:22:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,500 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.24,0:22:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that? RERY!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.34,0:23:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.54,0:23:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What is all that racket?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.98,0:23:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.04,0:23:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know how to drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.68,0:23:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of crappy landing was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.42,0:23:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.33,0:23:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on a fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.26,0:23:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Fish are no good at landing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.42,0:23:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, we gotta get to Rogue One!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.60,0:23:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so damn important\Nthat you have to grab
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.36,0:23:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,me by the neck and send\Nme crashing into...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.88,0:23:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place? Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.76,0:23:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.92,0:23:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.02,0:23:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If it isn't Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.80,0:23:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are those goons?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.18,0:23:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And where did they come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.62,0:23:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.86,0:23:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.22,0:23:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.13,0:23:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for you everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.58,0:23:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.94,0:23:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.18,0:23:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.09,0:23:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saving Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.24,0:23:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's wearing an explosive collar!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.04,0:24:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll never make it out alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.82,0:24:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, the Celestial Dragons are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.76,0:24:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything, Rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.84,0:24:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,See if I care!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.92,0:24:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just call him Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.20,0:24:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.24,0:24:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a fish man!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.66,0:24:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.57,0:24:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a fish man doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.32,0:24:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an octopus monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.12,0:24:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Kuma, I'm on my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.28,0:24:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Seize him at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.92,0:24:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamey's my friend and she's not for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.38,0:24:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.34,0:24:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep him away from the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.88,0:24:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a fish man doing on land?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.76,0:24:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet he spreads diseases.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.84,0:24:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.66,0:24:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Apprehend him already!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.22,0:24:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Rose, stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.78,0:24:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to the sea, you damn freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.68,0:24:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here already.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.10,0:24:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.94,0:24:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hachi, we need to run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.86,0:24:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's in danger now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.28,0:25:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me to let Kuma go? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.96,0:25:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do the people here hate him so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.48,0:25:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like Robin said before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.18,0:25:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They discriminate against fishmen\Nand merfolk on these islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.02,0:25:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They hate every last one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.78,0:25:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.82,0:25:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not any different from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.42,0:25:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.56,0:25:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I shot it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.76,0:25:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I took down a fish, man! Haki!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.28,0:25:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness someone shot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.20,0:25:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If that awful sea beast had gotten any\Ncloser, it would have made us all ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.78,0:26:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,True, and it was definitely\Nplotting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.06,0:26:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't have been much,\Nthough, even if it can walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.02,0:26:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still got a fish's brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.92,0:26:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Look father, I got a fish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.02,0:26:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I shot it and caught it all by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.66,0:26:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I can have it for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.42,0:26:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's free. It's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.04,0:26:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,An octopus for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.54,0:26:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I caught a fish man by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.50,0:26:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,An octopus for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.80,0:26:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What a deal, what a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.52,0:26:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,An octopus for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.80,0:26:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Free, free, free, free, free.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.30,0:26:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.02,0:26:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.08,0:26:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.14,0:26:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.78,0:26:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who screwed up. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.20,0:27:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't forget your promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.48,0:27:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said, you can't defy the celestial\Ndragons even if they kill someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.12,0:27:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a time when I was a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.32,0:27:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A criminal!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.24,0:27:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the punishment I deserve for\Ndoing all of those horrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.96,0:27:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.22,0:27:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean for everything\Nto turn out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.72,0:27:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to make amends\Nwith Nami however I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.82,0:27:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it wasn't much, I wanted\Nto be helpful to you and your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.86,0:27:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But I screwed that up, I guess,\Njust like every other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.76,0:27:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to do something right for
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.98,0:28:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,once and show Nami how sorry I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.18,0:28:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All my life, all I've ever\Ndone is cause trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.20,0:28:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.40,0:28:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.90,0:28:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.22,0:28:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop all that annoying babbling\Nfish before I shut you up for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.70,0:28:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how dare you don't\Nlook at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.68,0:28:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.59,0:28:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.94,0:28:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to get in really big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.52,0:28:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.52,0:28:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.10,0:28:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that man doing? He's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.38,0:28:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.28,0:28:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.56,0:29:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're annoying me too!
